# Widescreen display from F6's option menu in play, on a display of
# 1920x1080 (fixtures/widef6: holomap's save outside the prison,
# fixtures/outside, and the CD's LBA.CFG with WideScreen: OFF,
# recorded with -D 1920x1080). Continue saved game loads the save, and
# Twinsen walks. F6 opens the option menu over the scene, its eighth
# entry Widescreen display: OFF, and Return turns it ON: the scene drawn
# again under the menu on the whole screen of 852x480. Return to game
# draws the scene on the whole screen, Twinsen where he stood in the
# scene. F6 again and Return turn it OFF, and Return to game draws the
# scene on 640x480 again.

hold 0.05
sleep 40
key Down Return
sleep 3
key Return
hold 0.15
sleep 15
shot outside
down Up
sleep 1
up Up
sleep 1
shot walked
hold 0.05
key F6
sleep 3
shot menu
key Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 2
shot on
key Up Up Up Up Up Up Up
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 3
shot wide
key F6
sleep 3
key Down Down Down Down Down Down Down
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 2
shot off
key Up Up Up Up Up Up Up
sleep 1
key Return
sleep 3
shot narrow
